  "scope": "Explicit native learner admission and peer seeding; MR-10 remains IN_PROGRESS. Revision-bound administrative admission refreshes committed routes from preconfigured trusted endpoints. A purpose-separated authenticated TLS RPC requires a fresh safe ReadIndex and a published included cut. Opaque grants bind the target engine owner, process and original deadline. Ordered lease-bound body transfer retries with fresh grants after transport loss. A physically sealed image precedes atomic group/snapshot/configuration/binding/applied initialization with vote zero; permanent claims precede owner-bound attachment. Claimed blank identities and missing quorum are refused.",
